  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Saved model-space VPORT and named VIEW cameras, perspective and depth clipping, and GPU depth display. Adds legacy 3D polylines/polyface meshes, MESH wireframes, straight/elliptical and explicit spline ACIS solid boundaries, tolerant topology, and complete untrimmed ring-torus surface display. All 13 Waschbecken sample solids load as boundary wireframes. Nonplan/perspective views are display-only; measurements remain projected XY. Requires Windows and .NET 10 Desktop Runtime. General trimmed surface shading, editing and DXF writing remain unsupported.",
